# FitGen AI (Koda) — Complete Technical Context Report

---

## 1. Project Overview

**FitGen AI (Koda)** is an AI-powered personalized fitness plan generation API built on FastAPI. It generates structured 4-week workout and diet plans by combining user biometrics, optional YouTube video content analysis, and optional on-device body composition computer vision.

**Repository:** `d:\Genesis tech\Github repo\koda`  
**Company:** Genesis Tech  
**Stack Summary:**

| Layer | Technology |
|---|---|
| API Framework | FastAPI (async) |
| Task Queue | Celery + Redis |
| Database | SQLAlchemy 2.0 async (SQLite default / PostgreSQL prod) |
| LLM / Vision AI | Ollama (`llama3.2` text, `llava` vision) |
| On-Device Vision | MediaPipe Pose + MobileNetV2 (TensorFlow/Keras) |
| PDF Export | ReportLab |
| Frontend | Next.js (TypeScript, Tailwind CSS) |
| YouTube | `youtube-transcript-api` |
| Validation | Pydantic v2 |
| Migrations | Alembic |

---

## 2. Current Status

### Working / Implemented
- ✅ Full plan generation pipeline (Mode A/B/C) via [PlanOrchestrator](file:///d:/Genesis%20tech/Github%20repo/koda/src/core/orchestrator.py#87-669)
- ✅ Three orchestrator modes: profile-only (A), + YouTube (B), + vision/body composition (C)
- ✅ Async Celery task dispatch with Redis broker + result backend
- ✅ Job polling endpoint (GET `/plans/job/{job_id}`)
- ✅ PDF report generation with ReportLab (cover, metrics, diet, workout, roadmap, SWR)
- ✅ Body composition analysis: MediaPipe Pose + MobileNetV2 (on-device, no cloud)
- ✅ Shoulder-to-Waist Ratio (SWR) analysis and PDF rendering
- ✅ 4-phase 13-week Transformation Roadmap with per-phase day-by-day breakdown
- ✅ YouTube transcript ingestion with 12,000-char token guard and parallel fetch
- ✅ LLM exercise extraction, video classification (workout/diet/motivation/general)
- ✅ Safety filter (equipment + injury matching)
- ✅ Capacity score computation (strength metrics + activity + BMI + muscle + SWR)
- ✅ TDEE / BMR / macro computation (Mifflin-St Jeor + goal delta)
- ✅ Progressive overload (4-week, reps + weight scaling)
- ✅ User CRUD (SQLite/Postgres) with JSON blob storage
- ✅ Vision consent gate (HTTP 451 on missing `X-Vision-Consent: true` header)
- ✅ Smoke tests for orchestrator, SWR, vision, biometrics, intelligence

### Known Limitations / Missing for Launch
- ⚠️ **No real authentication** — `GET /users/me` returns the latest-created user (mock auth, no JWT)
- ⚠️ **No `plan_tasks.py`** — referenced but file doesn't exist (no dedicated plan worker module separate from [tasks.py](file:///d:/Genesis%20tech/Github%20repo/koda/src/workers/tasks.py))
- ⚠️ **MobileNetV2 imagenet weights used as a muscle proxy** — not a trained classifier; uses upper-half feature magnitude heuristic (lacks ground-truth labelled data)
- ⚠️ **No frontend plan display** — frontend shows landing/signup/onboarding/status pages but no plan viewer beyond PDF download
- ⚠️ **No email verification, password hashing, or session management**
- ⚠️ **PostgreSQL not supported on Python 3.14** — `asyncpg` and `psycopg2-binary` lack 3.14 wheels
- ⚠️ **`VideoAnalyst.process_video_stream`** uses `cv2.VideoCapture` (real-time video loop) — this runs in the API process and will block; not production-safe
- ⚠️ **Celery broker required for async dispatch** — no queue = `POST /plans/generate` fails at runtime

