## 5. Database Schema

### `user_records` (ORM: [UserRecord](file:///d:/Genesis%20tech/Github%20repo/koda/src/db/models.py#43-92))
| Column | Type | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| id | Integer PK | Auto-increment |
| user_id | String(64) | Public stable ID, unique |
| email | String(255) | Optional, unique |
| hashed_password | String(256) | Optional (no auth yet) |
| is_active | Boolean | Default True |
| profile_json | JSON | Full `UserProfile.model_dump()` blob |
| analysis_consent | Boolean | Mirrors vision consent |
| created_at | DateTime(tz) | DB server default |
| updated_at | DateTime(tz) | Auto-updated |

### `fitness_plan_records` (ORM: [FitnessPlanRecord](file:///d:/Genesis%20tech/Github%20repo/koda/src/db/models.py#96-153))
| Column | Type | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| id | Integer PK | Auto-increment |
| job_id | String(64) | Celery task ID, unique |
| user_id | String(64) FK | → user_records.user_id (CASCADE delete, nullable) |
| status | String(16) | pending / running / done / failed |
| request_json | JSON | Input [GeneratePlanRequest](file:///d:/Genesis%20tech/Github%20repo/koda/src/schemas/plan.py#56-89) snapshot |
| plan_json | JSON | Output `FitnessPlan.model_dump()` |
| error_detail | Text | Error message when failed |
| youtube_urls | JSON | List of URLs used |
| created_at | DateTime(tz) | DB server default |
| completed_at | DateTime(tz) | Set on done/failed |

> **Design principle:** Rich schemas stored as JSON blobs — avoids migration burden when Pydantic schemas evolve.

