## 6. API Endpoints

### Plans (`/api/v1/plans`)
| Method | Path | Auth | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| POST | `/generate` | None | Dispatch async Celery task → 202 + `JobResponse{job_id}` |
| GET | `/job/{job_id}` | None | Poll status → `JobStatusResponse{status, result?, error?}` |
| GET | `/job/{job_id}/pdf` | None | Download PDF (202 if still running, 400 if failed) |
| POST | `/generate/pdf` | None | Legacy sync plan + PDF — kept for backward compat |

### Users (`/api/v1/users`)
| Method | Path | Auth | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| GET | `/me` | Mock (latest user) | Return current user profile (flattened) |
| POST | `/` | None | Create user profile → 201 + [UserProfile](file:///d:/Genesis%20tech/Github%20repo/koda/src/schemas/user.py#44-56) |
| GET | `/{user_id}` | None | Get profile by ID |
| PUT | `/{user_id}` | None | Replace profile |
| DELETE | `/{user_id}` | None | Delete profile → 204 |

### Vision (`/api/v1/vision`)
| Method | Path | Auth | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| POST | `/analyze-body` | `X-Vision-Consent: true` | Multi-view body composition (1–3 images) → [BodyComposition](file:///d:/Genesis%20tech/Github%20repo/koda/src/schemas/vision.py#14-84) |

### System
| Method | Path | Description |
|---|---|---|
| GET | `/health` | Liveness check |
| GET | `/api/v1/celery-health` | Celery connectivity probe |
| POST | `/generate-plan` | Legacy 307 redirect → `/api/v1/plans/generate/pdf` |

