## 7. Schema Map (Pydantic)

### Input Chain for Plan Generation
```
GeneratePlanRequest
  ├── user_profile: UserProfile
  │     ├── biometrics: UserMetrics { age[15-60], weight_kg, height_cm, gender }
  │     ├── metrics: StrengthMetrics { pushup_count, situp_count, squat_count }
  │     ├── physical_activity: PhysicalActivity { activity_level, hours_per_day }
  │     ├── injuries: List[Injury]
  │     ├── equipment: List[Equipment]
  │     ├── experience_level: ExperienceLevel
  │     └── fitness_goal: FitnessGoal
  ├── youtube_urls: List[str]
  ├── transcript_text: Optional[str]
  └── body_composition: Optional[BodyComposition]   ← from prior vision call
```

### Output Schema
```
FitnessPlan
  ├── title: str
  ├── weeks: List[WeeklySchedule]
  │     └── WeeklySchedule { week_number, sessions: List[WorkoutSession] }
  │           └── WorkoutSession { day_name, exercises: List[WorkoutExercise], duration_min }
  │                 └── WorkoutExercise { exercise: Exercise, sets: List[WorkoutSet] }
  │                       └── WorkoutSet { reps, weight_kg, rest_sec, notes? }
  ├── body_metrics: Optional[BodyMetrics]   { bmi, bmr, tdee, calorie_target, macros... }
  ├── diet_notes: Optional[str]
  ├── body_composition: Optional[BodyComposition]
  └── roadmap: Optional[TransformationRoadmap]
        └── phases: List[PhaseGoal]  (4 phases × 13 weeks)
              └── PhaseGoal { phase_name, duration_weeks, weekly_plan: WeeklyPlan, ... }
                    └── WeeklyPlan { days: List[DailyWorkout] }
                          └── DailyWorkout { day_name, exercises: List[ScheduledExercise], rest_day? }
```

### Vision Output Schema
```
BodyComposition
  ├── fat_pct_low / fat_pct_high: Optional[float]
  ├── muscle_level: Optional[MuscleLevel]  (low|moderate|high|very_high)
  ├── body_type: Optional[BodyType]        (ectomorph|mesomorph|endomorph)
  ├── v_taper_ratio: Optional[float]
  ├── shoulder_width_px / waist_width_px: float
  ├── shoulder_waist_ratio: float          (SWR)
  ├── swr_category: SWRCategory            (OVERFAT|BALANCED|ATHLETIC)
  ├── posture_assessment: Optional[str]
  ├── is_valid_person: bool
  ├── confidence: float
  └── pose_detected: bool
```

