## 8. Frontend State

### Routes (Next.js App Router)
| Route | Description |
|---|---|
| `/` | Landing page (hero, brand, CTA → `/signup`) |
| `/signup` | Sign up form |
| `/login` | Login form |
| `/onboarding` | User onboarding / profile creation |
| `/dashboard` | User dashboard |
| `/status` | Plan job status page |

### Key Frontend Components
| Component | Description |
|---|---|
| [JobStatusPoller.tsx](file:///d:/Genesis%20tech/Github%20repo/koda/frontend/src/components/JobStatusPoller.tsx) | Polls `GET /plans/job/{job_id}`, shows progress bar with 5 pipeline steps, handles PDF download via `downloadPlanPdf()` |
| `Header` | Navigation header |
| `Button` | Reusable UI button |

### [JobStatusPoller](file:///d:/Genesis%20tech/Github%20repo/koda/frontend/src/components/JobStatusPoller.tsx#56-173) Progress Mapping
| Backend Status | Progress % | Active Step |
|---|---|---|
| `pending` | 15% | Step 0: Queued |
| `running` | 55% | Step 2: Analysing content |
| `done` | 100% | Step 4: Rendering PDF → Download button appears |
| `failed` | 100% | Step 4: Error + Try Again button |

### `useJobStatus` Hook
- Polls `GET /plans/job/{job_id}` on interval
- Stops polling on `done` or `failed`
- Exposes `{ status, error, isPolling, pollCount, stop }`

