| MobileNetV2 uses imagenet generic features as muscle proxy — not a trained classifier | MEDIUM | [body_composition.py](file:///d:/Genesis%20tech/Github%20repo/koda/src/services/vision/body_composition.py) / [vision_analyzer.py](file:///d:/Genesis%20tech/Github%20repo/koda/src/integrations/vision_analyzer.py) |
