## 10. Dependencies (Key)

```
FastAPI + Uvicorn          Web framework + ASGI server
Pydantic v2                Schema validation + settings
SQLAlchemy 2.0             ORM (async: aiosqlite, sync: plain sqlite3)
Celery + Redis             Background task queue
httpx                      Async HTTP (Ollama REST calls)
youtube-transcript-api     YouTube captions ingestion
mediapipe                  Pose landmark detection
opencv-python-headless     Image decode + preprocessing
tensorflow / keras         MobileNetV2 feature extraction
reportlab                  PDF generation
alembic                    DB migrations
```

