## 11. Changes from V1 to V2

| Area | V1 | V2 |
|---|---|---|
| LLM Backend | Google Gemini (`gemini_client.py`) | Ollama ([ollama_client.py](file:///d:/Genesis%20tech/Github%20repo/koda/src/integrations/ollama_client.py)) — `gemini_client` alias kept |
| Vision Intelligence | Gemini multimodal (`llava` only) | Dual pipeline: MediaPipe + MobileNetV2 + optional Ollama llava |
| Orchestrator modes | Single flow | Mode A (no content) / B (YouTube) / C (YouTube + vision) |
| DB Storage | In-memory dict (users) | SQLAlchemy + SQLite/PostgreSQL persisted records |
| YouTube | Single sync fetch | Parallel [fetch_many()](file:///d:/Genesis%20tech/Github%20repo/koda/src/services/intelligence/youtube.py#100-150) with token guard + video classification |
| Plan PDF sections | Basic workout table | Cover + Metrics + SWR + Diet + 4-phase Roadmap + Timeline + Progression Rules |
| SWR Analysis | Not present | Full SWR calculation, PDF section, capacity scoring bonus |
| Celery Integration | Partial | Full async dispatch + status polling + DB persistence |
| Safety Filter | Not present | [SafetyFilterEngine](file:///d:/Genesis%20tech/Github%20repo/koda/src/core/safety.py#5-49) (equipment + injury) |
| Transformation Roadmap | Not present | 4-phase 13-week roadmap with per-phase day-by-day |
| Frontend | Placeholder | Next.js with onboarding, dashboard, job status poller |

