---

## 14. Exception Taxonomy

```
DomainBaseError (500)
├── ValidationError (422)
│   ├── AgeOutOfRangeError       age not in 15–60
│   ├── InvalidURLError          bad YouTube URL
│   └── ConsentRequiredError     (451) no vision consent header
├── NotFoundError (404)
│   ├── UserNotFoundError
│   └── PlanNotFoundError
├── ExternalServiceError (502)
│   ├── OllamaUnavailableError   (503) Ollama unreachable
│   ├── TranscriptFetchError     YouTube transcript unavailable
│   └── VisionModelError        (500) MediaPipe/MobileNetV2 failed
├── PipelineError (500)
│   ├── PlanGenerationError      orchestrator pipeline error
│   └── JobDispatchError        (503) Celery dispatch failed
└── ConfigurationError (500)    missing/invalid server config
```

